			"text": "Good morning! No sawing or hammering today. Even the tools have a rest on Sunday."
		},
		"hello": {
			"mood": "joy",
			"text": "Well, hello! I'm Mr. Amos, the carpenter. If something's broken, bring it to me, and we'll mend it together.",
